<component>
  <section>
    <templateId root="1.3.6.1.4.1.19376.1.5.3.1.3.4"/>
    <code code="10164-2" codeSystem="2.16.840.1.113883.6.1" displayName="History of Present illness Narrative"/>
    <title>History of Present Illness</title>
    <text><paragraph>Mr. Natsume returns three days after his first visit and had an upper endoscopy this morning with Dr. Abrahamsen-Ito of gastroenterology. Since his first visit he has stopped ibuprofen and taken acetaminophen twice for headache. The epigastric pain continues, gnawing before meals and waking him at night, and is eased by food. His stools have been brown, with no further black stools since ten days before his first visit, and he has not vomited blood or felt faint. He fasted for the endoscopy and has recovered from the sedation. [S]</paragraph><table><thead><tr><th>Element</th><th>Detail</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Symptoms</td><td>Epigastric pain unchanged; no further black stools; no vomiting or fainting</td></tr><tr><td>Medicines</td><td>Ibuprofen stopped; acetaminophen twice</td></tr><tr><td>Testing today</td><td>Upper endoscopy with biopsies and a rapid urease test; hemoglobin</td></tr></tbody></table></text>

  </section>
</component>

